<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <!-- Interceptamos la llamada al reporte -->
    <template id="report_saleorder_raw_inherit_rms" inherit_id="sale.report_saleorder_raw">
        <xpath expr="//t[@t-call='sale.report_saleorder_document']" position="replace">
            <t t-if="doc.company_id.rms_template_selection == 'rms'">
                <t t-call="rms_document_format.rms_document_template" t-lang="doc.partner_id.lang"/>
            </t>
            <t t-else="">
                <t t-call="sale.report_saleorder_document" t-lang="doc.partner_id.lang"/>
            </t>
        </xpath>
    </template>

    <!-- Nueva Plantilla RMS Custom -->
    <template id="rms_document_template">
        <t t-call="web.basic_layout">
            <style>
                .rms_page {
                    font-family: 'Helvetica', 'Arial', sans-serif;
                    font-size: 10px;
                    color: #000;
                }
                .rms_header_table {
                    width: 100%;
                    border: none;
                    margin-bottom: 5px;
                }
                .rms_budget_number {
                    font-size: 24px;
                    font-weight: bold;
                    text-align: right;
                }
                .rms_date_block {
                    font-size: 14px;
                    font-weight: bold;
                    text-align: right;
                    margin-top: 5px;
                }
                .rms_date_label {
                    font-size: 14px;
                    margin-right: 20px;
                }
                .rms_address_table {
                    width: 100%;
                    border: none;
                    margin-top: 20px;
                }
                .rms_address_cell {
                    width: 50%;
                    vertical-align: top;
                    line-height: 1.3;
                }
                .rms_table {
                    width: 100% !important;
                    table-layout: fixed;
                    border-collapse: collapse;
                    margin-top: 20px;
                }
                .rms_table th {
                    background-color: #fff;
                    border-top: 1.5px solid #000 !important;
                    border-bottom: 1.5px solid #000 !important;
                    padding: 4px !important;
                }
                .rms_table td {
                    border: none !important;
                    padding: 3px 2px !important;
                }
                .rms_totals_table {
                    width: 100%;
                    table-layout: fixed;
                    border: 1.5px solid #000;
                    border-collapse: collapse;
                    margin-bottom: 20px;
                }
                .rms_totals_table th, .rms_totals_table td {
                    border: 1.2px solid #000;
                    text-align: center;
                    padding: 6px;
                }
                .rms_totals_table th {
                    font-size: 9px;
                    font-weight: bold;
                }
                .rms_totals_table td {
                    font-size: 11px;
                    font-weight: bold;
                }
                .footer {
                    width: 100%;
                }
            </style>

            <div class="page rms_page">
                <!-- LOGOS SUPERIORES -->
                <table class="rms_header_table">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="width: 50%;">
                            <img t-if="doc.company_id.logo" t-att-src="image_data_uri(doc.company_id.logo)" style="max-height: 70px; width: auto;"/>
                        </td>
                        <td style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
                            <img t-if="doc.company_id.rms_header_logo_right" t-att-src="image_data_uri(doc.company_id.rms_header_logo_right)" style="max-height: 90px; width: auto;"/>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>

                <!-- NÚMERO DE PRESUPUESTO Y FECHA -->
                <div class="rms_budget_number">
                    PRESUPUESTO <span t-field="doc.name"/>
                </div>
                <div class="rms_date_block">
                    <span class="rms_date_label">FECHA</span>
                    <span t-field="doc.date_order" t-options='{"widget": "date", "format": "dd/MM/yy"}'/>
                </div>

                <!-- BLOQUES DE DIRECCIÓN -->
                <table class="rms_address_table">
                    <tr>
                        <td class="rms_address_cell">
                            <strong><span t-field="doc.company_id.name"/></strong><br/>
                            CIF: <span t-field="doc.company_id.vat"/><br/>
                            <span t-field="doc.company_id.street"/><br/>
                            <span t-field="doc.company_id.zip"/> <span t-field="doc.company_id.city"/><br/>
                            <span t-field="doc.company_id.state_id.name"/><br/>
                            TELEF.: <span t-field="doc.company_id.phone"/><br/>
                            <span t-field="doc.company_id.email"/>
                        </td>
                        <td class="rms_address_cell" style="padding-left: 20px;">
                            <strong><span t-field="doc.partner_id.name"/></strong><br/>
                            <t t-if="doc.partner_id.ref">Cod. Cliente: <span t-field="doc.partner_id.ref"/> </t>
                            CIF: <span t-field="doc.partner_id.vat"/><br/>
                            <span t-field="doc.partner_id.street"/><br/>
                            <span t-field="doc.partner_id.zip"/> <span t-field="doc.partner_id.city"/><br/>
                            <span t-field="doc.partner_id.state_id.name"/><br/>
                            <span t-field="doc.partner_id.phone"/>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>

                <!-- TABLA DE PRODUCTOS -->
                <table class="table table-sm rms_table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th style="width: 13%;">Código</th>
                            <th style="width: 4%; text-align: center;">Cant.</th>
                            <th style="width: 49%;">Descripción</th>
                            <th style="width: 12%; text-align: right;">PVP sin IVA</th>
                            <th style="width: 5%; text-align: center;">Dto1</th>
                            <th style="width: 5%; text-align: center;">Dto2</th>
                            <th style="width: 5%; text-align: center;">Dto3</th>
                            <th style="width: 7%; text-align: right;">Total Neto</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr t-foreach="doc.order_line" t-as="line">
                            <t t-if="not line.display_type">
                                <td><span t-field="line.product_id.default_code"/></td>
                                <td style="text-align: center;"><span t-field="line.product_uom_qty" t-options='{"widget": "float", "precision": 2}'/></td>
                                <td>
                                    <t t-set="desc" t-value="line.name"/>
                                    <t t-if="line.product_id">
                                        <t t-set="desc" t-value="desc.replace(line.product_id.display_name, line.product_id.product_tmpl_id.name).replace('[' + (line.product_id.default_code or '') + '] ', '')"/>
                                    </t>
                                    <span t-esc="desc"/>
                                </td>
                                <td style="text-align: right;"><span t-field="line.price_unit" t-options='{"widget": "monetary", "display_currency": doc.currency_id}'/></td>
                                <td style="text-align: center;">
                                    <t t-if="line.discount1 > 0">
                                        <span t-field="line.discount1" t-options='{"widget": "float", "precision": 0}'/>%
                                    </t>
                                </td>
                                <td style="text-align: center;">
                                    <t t-if="line.discount2 > 0">
                                        <span t-field="line.discount2" t-options='{"widget": "float", "precision": 0}'/>%
                                    </t>
                                </td>
                                <td style="text-align: center;">
                                    <t t-if="line.discount3 > 0">
                                        <span t-field="line.discount3" t-options='{"widget": "float", "precision": 0}'/>%
                                    </t>
                                </td>
                                <td style="text-align: right;">
                                    <span t-field="line.price_subtotal" t-options='{"widget": "monetary", "display_currency": doc.currency_id}'/>
                                </td>
                            </t>
                            <t t-if="line.display_type == 'line_section'">
                                <td colspan="8" style="background-color: #f2f2f2; font-weight: bold;">
                                    <span t-field="line.name"/>
                                </td>
                            </t>
                            <t t-if="line.display_type == 'line_note'">
                                <td colspan="2"/>
                                <td colspan="6" style="font-style: italic;">
                                    <span t-field="line.name"/>
                                </td>
                            </t>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>

                <!-- NOTAS DEL PRESUPUESTO -->
                <div t-if="doc.note" style="margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 11px;">
                    <span t-field="doc.note"/>
                </div>

                <!-- PIE DE PÁGINA (Ahora incluye los totales) -->
                <div class="footer o_standard_footer">
                    <!-- TOTALES MOVIDOS AQUÍ -->
                    <div t-if="doc.payment_term_id" style="font-size: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                        <strong>Forma de pago:</strong> <span t-field="doc.payment_term_id.name"/>
                    </div>
                    <table class="rms_totals_table" style="width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; border: 1.5px solid #000; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                        <thead>
                            <tr style="border: 1.2px solid #000;">
                                <th style="border: 1.2px solid #000; text-align: center; padding: 6px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: bold;">Total Base</th>
                                <th style="border: 1.2px solid #000; text-align: center; padding: 6px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: bold;">% Dto Especial</th>
                                <th style="border: 1.2px solid #000; text-align: center; padding: 6px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: bold;">Importe Dto Especial</th>
                                <th style="border: 1.2px solid #000; text-align: center; padding: 6px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: bold;">Bases Imponibles</th>
                                <th style="border: 1.2px solid #000; text-align: center; padding: 6px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: bold;">% IVA</th>
                                <th style="border: 1.2px solid #000; text-align: center; padding: 6px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: bold;">Imp. IVA</th>
                                <th style="border: 1.2px solid #000; text-align: center; padding: 6px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: bold;">TOTAL</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr style="border: 1.2px solid #000;">
                                <td style="border: 1.2px solid #000; text-align: center; padding: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;">
                                    <span t-field="doc.amount_untaxed_before_global_discounts" t-options='{"widget": "monetary", "display_currency": doc.currency_id}'/>
                                </td>
                                <td style="border: 1.2px solid #000; text-align: center; padding: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;">
                                    <t t-if="doc.global_discount_ids">
                                        <t t-set="gdisc_pcts" t-value="', '.join(map(str, doc.global_discount_ids.mapped('discount')))"/>
                                        <span t-esc="gdisc_pcts"/>%
                                    </t>
                                    <t t-else="">0,00</t>
                                </td>
                                <td style="border: 1.2px solid #000; text-align: center; padding: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;">
                                    <span t-field="doc.amount_global_discount" t-options='{"widget": "monetary", "display_currency": doc.currency_id}'/>
                                </td>
                                <td style="border: 1.2px solid #000; text-align: center; padding: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;">
                                    <span t-field="doc.amount_untaxed" t-options='{"widget": "monetary", "display_currency": doc.currency_id}'/>
                                </td>
                                <td style="border: 1.2px solid #000; text-align: center; padding: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;">
                                    <t t-set="tax_names" t-value="', '.join(doc.order_line.tax_ids.mapped('name'))"/>
                                    <span t-esc="tax_names"/>
                                </td>
                                <td style="border: 1.2px solid #000; text-align: center; padding: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;"><span t-field="doc.amount_tax" t-options='{"widget": "monetary", "display_currency": doc.currency_id}'/></td>
                                <td style="border: 1.2px solid #000; text-align: center; padding: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;"><span t-field="doc.amount_total" t-options='{"widget": "monetary", "display_currency": doc.currency_id}'/></td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>

                    <div style="font-size: 11px;">
                        <p>Este presupuesto tiene una validez de 30 días. Solo se efectuará el pedido si se confirma por escrito.</p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Faldón y Texto Legal -->
                    <img t-if="doc.company_id.rms_footer_logos" t-att-src="image_data_uri(doc.company_id.rms_footer_logos)" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; margin: 0 auto;"/>
                    <div style="font-size: 10px; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;">
                        <p>Como responsable del tratamiento de sus datos, tratamos la información que nos facilita con el fin de prestarles el servicio solicitado y realizar la facturación del mismo. Se conservarán un plazo mínimo de 5 años. No se cederán a terceros, salvo obligación legal. Puede ejercer sus derechos a través del siguiente correo: info@rmsproaudio.com o a la dirección postal C/ Leonardo Da Vinci, 11 Teatro Cartuja Center 41092 Sevilla.</p>
                        <p><span t-field="doc.company_id.name"/> CIF: <span t-field="doc.company_id.vat"/></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </t>
    </template>
</odoo>